     95. │   ├── semantic_matcher.py    # From semantic-search (extension)
     96. │   ├── schema_validator.py    # From config-validator (extension)
     97. │   └── link_validator.py      # Link checking logic
     98. └── tests/
     99.     ├── __init__.py
     100.     ├── test_agent.py           # Unit tests (18+)
     101.     └── test_integration.py     # Integration tests (5+)
     102. ```
     103. 
     104. ## 🔧 Component Reuse Strategy
     105. 
     106. ### Base Component (75% reuse)
     107. - **doc-freshness-checker**: Freshness detection, content aging analysis
     108. 
     109. ### Extensions
     110. - **semantic-search**: Vector embeddings for code-doc semantic matching
