       ### Breaking Changes
       - None (initial release)
       
       ### Deprecated
       - None (initial release)
       
       ### Security
       - All patches validated against multiple CVE databases
       - No known security vulnerabilities in the agent itself
       - Security validation prevents introduction of new vulnerabilities
       
