       Critical/High: 1
       Medium/Low: 3
       
       Patching CVE-2024-RUST-CRIT (URGENT)...
         ✅ Applied immediately
       
       ⏸️  Scheduling 3 medium/low patches for next maintenance window
       
       📊 Final Report:
         Patched: 1/4
         Risk Reduced: 9.20
