       Complete the security-vulnerability-patcher agent implementation by creating all required files.
       
       ## Context
       I'm implementing Agent 4 (security-vulnerability-patcher) in Phase 9.1. The directory structure exists at `.github/agents/security-vulnerability-patcher/` with empty __init__.py files.
       
